issance list? It lists The Rescuers Down Under (1990) but not The Rescuers. No date. So we lack explicit release year for The Rescuers. Could we use that The Rescuers is older than The Rescuers Down Under? Not given. Might be insufficient. The question: Which Walt Disney film was released earlier, The Rescuers or The Muppets? We need to answer: The Rescuers was released earlier. But need citation for The Rescuers release year. Not present. Could we use indirect evidence: The Rescuers is a 1977 animated film (mentioned in Disney Renaissance description: \"the sequel to the 1977 animated film 'The Rescuers'\"). Indeed sentence 1 of The Rescuers Down Under evidence: \"the sequel to the 1977 animated film 'The Rescuers'\". That gives year 1977. So we have citation: The Rescuers Down Under article sentence 1. That gives release year 1977 for The Rescuers. Good.\n\nNow for The Muppets film release year: The soundtrack evidence says released November 22, 2011 for the musical comedy film \"The Muppets\". That implies film released 2011. So we have citation: The Muppets (soundtrack) sentence 0.\n\nThus answer: The Rescuers was released earlier. Provide citations: [\"The Rescuers Down Under\",1] and [\"The Muppets (soundtrack)\",0].\n\nReturn JSON."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1620,"completion_tokens":790,"total_tokens":2410,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791981897,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}